- Never load backend/venv, frontend/node_modules into context
- Exclude build outputs: backend/app/routes/__pycache__, frontend/dist, backend/app/routes
- Sensitive paths are blocked: .env, .env.example

## Module boundaries
When implementing features, identify the owning module first, then scope reads to that module plus shared utilities.
